    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/965a8aa560cde1e6f894ddbf148b6cb8.avif?t=1752631182\" width=616 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/a7d2504e5a904ac100ef4bd8f29c0592.avif?t=1752631182\" width=616 height=44 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT US</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STARSPACE </strong>is proud to have pioneered the future of home computing by launching mobOS into orbit, the most powerful and comfortable computing experience for any kind of user. Whether you're new to computers or a total tech whiz, mobOS has everything you'll ever need for the rapidly growing online world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER - (06/27/2004)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>STARSPACE</strong>, we are aware more than anyone how current world events are affecting people's daily lives. We are wholly dedicated to ensuring an experience of comfort and familiarity as to make sure your transition to the online world is as smooth and easy as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/a7d2504e5a904ac100ef4bd8f29c0592.avif?t=1752631182\" width=616 height=44 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is MobOS?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mobOS is a nonlinear operating system and internet exploration game set in 2005. Once you start playing, the clock in game is tied to your actual computer's time and date, updating in game pages, forums, software, updates, and more throughout real life time depending on how you interact with them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open ended and vast fictional internet full of forums, in-browser games, mysteries, downloadable software and music, desktop pets, viruses, and much more as it evolves and grows with you and your impact on it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not Convinced?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hurt this guy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/fde80bbccb9a9cb317281fe35fcbd1d2.poster.avif?t=1752631182\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/fde80bbccb9a9cb317281fe35fcbd1d2.webm?t=1752631182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/fde80bbccb9a9cb317281fe35fcbd1d2.mp4?t=1752631182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/965a8aa560cde1e6f894ddbf148b6cb8.avif?t=1752631182\" width=616 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/a7d2504e5a904ac100ef4bd8f29c0592.avif?t=1752631182\" width=616 height=44 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT US</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STARSPACE </strong>is proud to have pioneered the future of home computing by launching mobOS into orbit, the most powerful and comfortable computing experience for any kind of user. Whether you're new to computers or a total tech whiz, mobOS has everything you'll ever need for the rapidly growing online world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER - (06/27/2004)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>STARSPACE</strong>, we are aware more than anyone how current world events are affecting people's daily lives. We are wholly dedicated to ensuring an experience of comfort and familiarity as to make sure your transition to the online world is as smooth and easy as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/a7d2504e5a904ac100ef4bd8f29c0592.avif?t=1752631182\" width=616 height=44 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is MobOS?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mobOS is a nonlinear operating system and internet exploration game set in 2005. Once you start playing, the clock in game is tied to your actual computer's time and date, updating in game pages, forums, software, updates, and more throughout real life time depending on how you interact with them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open ended and vast fictional internet full of forums, in-browser games, mysteries, downloadable software and music, desktop pets, viruses, and much more as it evolves and grows with you and your impact on it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not Convinced?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hurt this guy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/fde80bbccb9a9cb317281fe35fcbd1d2.poster.avif?t=1752631182\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/fde80bbccb9a9cb317281fe35fcbd1d2.webm?t=1752631182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/fde80bbccb9a9cb317281fe35fcbd1d2.mp4?t=1752631182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Explore an open ended internet and operating system set in a 2000s alternate reality that changes over real life time depending on how you interact with it. Discover secrets through the web, download games, become an active member in communities and more. The world is at your fingertips.",
